sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator
    participant Runner as scripts/poc
    participant Docker
    participant Entry as entrypoint.py
    participant Disk as Persistent /data
    participant Sup as supervisor.py
    participant Anki as Anki + AnkiConnect
    participant Driver as Rust readiness check
    User->>Runner: up (after successful onboarding)
    Runner->>Docker: compose up -d anki
    Docker->>Entry: start with volume + secret mounts
    Entry->>Disk: acquire exclusive process lock
    alt Another process owns this volume
        Disk-->>Entry: lock acquisition fails
        Note over Entry: Stop before modifying profile or add-on
    else Lock acquired
        Entry->>Disk: check pinned revision, write add-on config
        Entry->>Sup: exec as non-root, inherit lock descriptor
        Sup->>Sup: start Xvfb, wait for its socket
        Sup->>Disk: prepare_profile.py checks auth and initialization
        Sup->>Anki: start with explicit base directory and profile
        Anki->>Disk: open collection and saved authentication
        Driver->>Anki: check API/version, profile, session, deck, fields
        Anki-->>Driver: validated collection and capabilities
        Note over Driver: READY checks local contract, remote auth can later expire
    end
